              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹುಲ್ಲುಗಾವಲು — hullugāvalu — \"a grassland; a pasture\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹುಲ್ಲುಗಾವಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಂಕೆಗಳು ಮೇಯುತ್ತಿದ್ದವು. hullugāvalinalli jiṅkegaḷu mēyuttiddavu. Deer were grazing on the grassland."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹುಲ್ಲು, grass, plus ಕಾವಲು, guarded land."
            }
          ]
        },
