          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹುಲ್ಲುಗಾವಲು (hullugāvalu) is a native Kannada compound of ಹುಲ್ಲು, \"grass\" (DEDR 4300), and kāvalu, \"guarded land, a reserve\", built on kā, \"to guard\" (DEDR 1416)."
